# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 14ac2acf5353b6f9; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-APPS-48
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 14ac2acf5353b6f9
doc: Settings, Clusters, Platform services lists the Registry row (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Clusters, P: the Platform services panel lists the Registry row that creates the local image registry in one step
not-covered: the registry pod pulled by the cluster
not-covered: Enter creating it and Remove (no cluster in a scratch guest)
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Clusters
click-sidebar Clusters
wait app=Settings page="Clusters"
shot page
expect-not-blank
key P
wait app=Settings text="Platform services"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Registry
expect-page Clusters
